#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Light-gun mode"
msgstr "Valguspüssi režiim"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Video"
msgstr "Video"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Wait for vertical blank before presenting.\n"
"Prevents tearing but adds up to one frame of latency."
msgstr ""
"Oota enne kuvamist vertikaalset tagasijooksu.\n"
"Väldib rebenemist, kuid lisab kuni ühe kaadri viivitust."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Teated"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Automatic (system)"
msgstr "Automaatne (süsteem)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Keel"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "GPU"
msgstr "GPU"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Auto (best)"
msgstr "Automaatne (parim)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Renderer"
msgstr "Renderdaja"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Software"
msgstr "Tarkvaraline"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Which renderer draws the game. Applies on the\n"
"next launch - save settings and relaunch."
msgstr ""
"Milline renderdaja mängu joonistab. Rakendub järgmisel\n"
"käivitusel - salvesta seaded ja käivita uuesti."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Window size"
msgstr "Akna suurus"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Width"
msgstr "Laius"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Height"
msgstr "Kõrgus"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "1x (native)"
msgstr "1x (algne)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "8x (4K)"
msgstr "8x (4K)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "3D render scale"
msgstr "3D renderdamise skaala"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Internal 3D rendering resolution. Higher is crisper 3D\n"
"(2D/HUD stays sharp). GPU backends only; the software\n"
"renderer stays native. Applies on the next launch - save\n"
"settings and relaunch."
msgstr ""
"Sisemine 3D renderdamise eraldusvõime. Suurem on teravam 3D\n"
"(2D/HUD jääb teravaks). Ainult GPU taustaprogrammid; tarkvaraline\n"
"renderdaja jääb algseks. Rakendub järgmisel käivitusel -\n"
"salvesta seaded ja käivita uuesti."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bilinear"
msgstr "Bilineaarne"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Integer"
msgstr "Täisarvuline"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Nearest"
msgstr "Lähim"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sharp-bilinear"
msgstr "Terav bilineaarne"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "2D scaling"
msgstr "2D skaleerimine"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How the frame is magnified to the window.\n"
"Sharp-bilinear keeps 2D text crisp without the shimmer\n"
"nearest shows at non-integer window sizes. Integer snaps\n"
"to a whole multiple (pixel-perfect, with black bars).\n"
"Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Kuidas kaader aknani suurendatakse.\n"
"Terav bilineaarne hoiab 2D teksti teravana ilma värelemiseta,\n"
"mida „Lähim“ mittetäisarvulistel akende suurustel näitab.\n"
"„Täisarvuline“ kasutab täiskordset (pikslitäpne, mustade\n"
"ribadega). Rakendub kohe."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "4:3 (arcade)"
msgstr "4:3 (arkaad)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Square pixels"
msgstr "Ruutpikslid"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stretch"
msgstr "Venita"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Aspect"
msgstr "Kuvasuhe"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"4:3 is the arcade monitor's shape (the default).\n"
"Square pixels shows the raw 496x384 (slightly narrow).\n"
"Stretch fills the whole window. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"4:3 on arkaadimonitori kuju (vaikimisi).\n"
"Ruutpikslid näitab töötlemata 496x384 (veidi kitsas).\n"
"„Venita“ täidab kogu akna. Rakendub kohe."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "CRT filter"
msgstr "CRT-filter"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A cosmetic arcade-monitor look over the finished frame:\n"
"scanlines, an RGB shadow mask, glow and optional screen\n"
"curvature. Purely visual; applies live."
msgstr ""
"Kosmeetiline arkaadimonitori välimus valmis kaadri peal:\n"
"skaneerimisjooned, RGB varjumask, kuma ja valikuline\n"
"ekraani kumerus. Puhtalt visuaalne; rakendub kohe."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scanlines"
msgstr "Skaneerimisjooned"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mask"
msgstr "Mask"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Glow"
msgstr "Kuma"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Curvature"
msgstr "Kumerus"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enhancement (cosmetic, beyond the original hardware)"
msgstr "Täiustused (kosmeetilised, üle algse riistvara)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Anisotropic"
msgstr "Anisotroopne"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Faithful"
msgstr "Algupärane"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "3D texture filter"
msgstr "3D tekstuurifilter"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "(unsupported)"
msgstr "(pole toetatud)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "This GPU does not report anisotropic filtering."
msgstr "See GPU ei teata anisotroopsest filtreerimisest."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Anisotropy"
msgstr "Anisotroopia"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "2D upscale"
msgstr "2D suurendus"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Edge-smooth the 2D layers (HUD, text, menus). xBR and\n"
"ScaleFX round diagonals; Faithful keeps crisp pixels.\n"
"Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Silu 2D kihtide servi (HUD, tekst, menüüd). xBR ja\n"
"ScaleFX ümardavad diagonaale; „Algupärane“ hoiab\n"
"teravad pikslid. Rakendub kohe."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Blended"
msgstr "Segatud"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stipple"
msgstr "Punktiir"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Translucency"
msgstr "Läbipaistvus"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The hardware draws see-through surfaces (lights, glass,\n"
"shadows) as a checkerboard. Blended draws the 50%\n"
"see-through surface it's trying to achieve. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Riistvara joonistab läbipaistvad pinnad (tuled, klaas,\n"
"varjud) malelauamustrina. „Segatud“ joonistab 50%\n"
"läbipaistva pinna, mida taotletakse. Rakendub kohe."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Custom textures"
msgstr "Kohandatud tekstuurid"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Replace the game's 3D textures with images saved in\n"
"saves/textures/<game>/load, named as dumped. GPU\n"
"renderers only; Reload picks up edited files."
msgstr ""
"Asenda mängu 3D tekstuurid piltidega kaustast\n"
"saves/textures/<game>/load, nimetatud nagu väljavõttel.\n"
"Ainult GPU renderdajad; „Laadi uuesti“ loeb muudetud failid."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%zu loaded"
msgstr "%zu laaditud"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reload"
msgstr "Laadi uuesti"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dump textures"
msgstr "Tekstuuride väljavõte"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Collect every 3D texture the game draws and write them,\n"
"with an index.html to browse, to saves/textures/<game>/dump\n"
"when the game exits or this is turned off."
msgstr ""
"Kogu kõik mängu joonistatud 3D tekstuurid ja kirjuta need\n"
"koos sirvimiseks mõeldud index.html-iga kausta\n"
"saves/textures/<game>/dump, kui mäng lõpeb või see lülitatakse välja."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Audio"
msgstr "Heli"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Paths"
msgstr "Teed"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Browse..."
msgstr "Sirvi..."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Config directory"
msgstr "Seadete kaust"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where sm2-emu.ini is read from and saved to.\n"
"Set with --config <dir>; cannot be changed here."
msgstr ""
"Kust sm2-emu.ini loetakse ja kuhu see salvestatakse.\n"
"Määrab --config <dir>; siin muuta ei saa."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "ROM directory"
msgstr "ROM-ide kaust"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where the ROM archives live. A game launched by name is\n"
"loaded from here as <name>.zip or <name>.7z."
msgstr ""
"Kus asuvad ROM-arhiivid. Nime järgi käivitatud mäng\n"
"laaditakse siit kui <name>.zip või <name>.7z."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Saves directory"
msgstr "Salvestuste kaust"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Battery-backed saves: per-game NVRAM (.nv) and EEPROM\n"
"(.eeprom) images -- high scores and operator settings."
msgstr ""
"Patareitoitega salvestused: mängupõhised NVRAM (.nv) ja EEPROM\n"
"(.eeprom) tõmmised -- rekordid ja operaatori seaded."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshots directory"
msgstr "Ekraanipiltide kaust"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where F12 screenshots are written."
msgstr "Kuhu F12 ekraanipildid kirjutatakse."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scrape artwork online"
msgstr "Laadi kujundus võrgust"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Let the game picker fetch box art and descriptions from\n"
"ArcadeDB over the network. Off keeps sm2-emu offline: the\n"
"picker still lists and launches every game, with placeholder\n"
"tiles and no descriptions."
msgstr ""
"Luba mänguvalijal tuua ArcadeDB-st võrgu kaudu karbipilte\n"
"ja kirjeldusi. Väljas hoiab sm2-emu võrguühenduseta:\n"
"valija loetleb ja käivitab ikka kõik mängud, kohatäitja-\n"
"paanide ja ilma kirjeldusteta."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gamepad"
msgstr "Mängupult"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Wheel"
msgstr "Rool"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
